CHAPTER.VERS:
Say now to the rebellious house, Don't you

          {+}
         know what these things mean? Tell them, Look, the king of Babylon came to Jerusalem, and took its king, and its princes, and brought them to himself to Babylon:

And all his places of refuge with all his bands will fall by the sword, and those who remain will be scattered toward every wind: and you

          {+}
         will know that I, Yahweh, have spoken it.
